  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "31",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 31"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "31",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo byonna bwe byaggwa, Abayisirayiri bonna abaaliyo ne bagenda mu bibuga bya Yuda, ne baasaayasa amayinja agaasinzibwanga, ne bamenyaamenya n'empagi za Baasera. Ne basaanyizaawo ddala ebifo ebigulumivu n'ebyoto ebyali mu Yuda, ne mu Benyamini, ne mu Efulayimu ne mu Manase. Awo Abayisirayiri bwe baamala okubisaanyaawo byonna, ne baddayo mu bibuga byabwe, ku butaka bwabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebirabo eby'Okusinza",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keezeekiya n'addira bakabona n'Abaleevi n'abassa mu bibinja, buli omu ng'obuweereza bwe bwali, oba kabona oba muleevi, okuwangayo ebiweebwayo ebyokebwa n'ebiweebwayo olw'emirembe okuweerezanga, n'okwebazanga, n'okutenderezanga ku nzigi eza yeekaalu ya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.31.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.31.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka n'awaayo ku byobugagga bwe ebiweebwayo ebyokebwa eby'enkya n'eby'akawungeezi, n'ebiweebwayo ebyokebwa ebya ssabbiiti, n'eby'emyezi egyakaboneka, n'assaawo n'embaga ezaalagirwa nga bwe kyawandiikibwa mu tteeka lya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.31.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.31.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'alagira abantu abaabeeranga mu Yerusaalemi okuwangayo omugabo nga bwe kyali kibagwanira eri bakabona n'Abaleevi, nabo beeweerengayo ddala nga bwe kyalagirwa mu tteeka lya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.31.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.31.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo ekiragiro ekyo bwe kyabuna wonna, amangwago Abayisirayiri ne bawaayo ku bibala byabwe ebibereberye bingi eby'eŋŋaano, n'ebya wayini omusu, n'eby'amafuta, n'eby'omubisi gw'enjuki ne ku ebyo byonna ebyava mu nnimiro. Ne baleeta bingi nnyo, ekitundu eky'ekkumi ku buli kintu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ba Isirayiri ne Yuda abaabeeranga mu bibuga bya Yuda, nabo ne baleeta ekimu eky'ekkumi ku nte n'endiga, n'ekimu eky'ekkumi eky'ebintu ebyatukuzibwa ebyayawulirwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.31.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.31.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda waabwe, ne babituuma entuumo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baatandika okutuuma ebintu ebyo entuumo mu mwezi ogwokusatu ne bamaliriza mu mwezi ogw'omusanvu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Keezeekiya n'abakungu be, bwe bajja ne balaba entuumo ne beebaza",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.31.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.31.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", ne basabira n'abantu be, Isirayiri, omukisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keezeekiya n'abuuza bakabona n'Abaleevi ebikwata ku ntuumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azaliya kabona asinga obukulu ow'omu nnyumba ya Zadooki n'amuddamu nti, \"Okuva abantu lwe baatandika okuleeta ebirabo byabwe mu yeekaalu ya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.31.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", tubadde n'ebyokulya ebiwera n'ebirala ne bifikkawo, kubanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.31.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "awadde abantu be omukisa, n'ebifisseewo bye bino obungi.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Keezeekiya n'alagira bateeketeeke amaterekero mu yeekaalu ya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.31.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.31.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", ne bagateekateeka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne balyoka baleeta ebirabo, ebintu eby'ekimu eky'ekkumi, n'ebintu ebyatukuzibwa. Konaniya Omuleevi ye yavunaanyizibwanga ebintu ebyo, ate nga Simeeyi muganda we ye mumyuka we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yekyeri, ne Azaziya, ne Nakasi, ne Asakeri, ne Yerimosi, Yozabadi, ne Eryeri, ne Isumakiya, ne Makasi ne Benaya be baabayambangako. Konaniya ne Simeeyi muganda we, baalondebwa Kabaka Keezeekiya ne Azaliya omukungu omukulu eyavunaanyizibwanga yeekaalu ya Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole mutabani wa Imuna Omuleevi, omuggazi w'omulyango ogw'ebuvanjuba, ye yavunaanyizibwanga ebyo bye baawangayo eri Katonda ku bwabwe awatali kuwalirizibwa, ng'agabanyamu ebyatonebwanga eri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.31.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.31.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", n'ebirabo ebyayawulibwanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Edene, ne Miniyamini, ne Yesuwa, ne Semaaya, ne Amaliya ne Sekaniya, be baamuyambangako n'obwesigwa mu bibuga bya bakabona okugabiranga bakabona bannaabwe ng'ebibinja byabwe bwe byali, abakulu n'abato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ate era baagabiranga n'abalenzi ab'emyaka esatu n'okukirawo abaali babalibbwa ng'okuzaalibwa kwe mbala bwe kwalinga, abo bonna abayingiranga mu yeekaalu ya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.31.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.31.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okutuukirizanga emirimu gyabwe nga bwe kyabagwaniranga, mu bibinja byabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bagabiranga ne bakabona abaabalibwa ng'enzaalwa mu kubala okw'okuzaalibwa kwabwe bwe kwali, n'Abaleevi abaali ab'emyaka amakumi abiri n'okukirawo ne babagabira ng'eby'obuvunaanyizibwa bwabwe mu bibinja byabwe bwe byali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwo mwe mwali abaana abato, n'abakyala, ne batabani baabwe, ne bawala baabwe ng'ebitundu byabwe bwe byali biwandiikiddwa mu byafaayo eby'okuzaalibwa. Ne babeera beesigwa mu kwekuuma nga batukuvu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bazzukulu ba Alooni, bakabona abaabeeranga ku ttaka okwalimibwanga, eryabanga ery'ebibuga byabwe, mu buli kibuga, buli musajja mu bo yaweebwa omugabo, n'abo bonna abaali bawandiikiddwa mu byafaayo eby'okuzaalibwa kw'Abaleevi, nabo ne bagabana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
